{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测macOS修改授权插件。对应需求：持久化。官方：Authorization Plugin Modification。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】macOS修改授权插件","references":["https://developer.apple.com/documentation/security/authorization_plug-ins","https://www.xorrior.com/persistent-credential-theft/"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"e6c98d38-633d-4b3e-9387-42112cd5ac10","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 macOS 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: macOS","主题: 持久化","来源: 默认","对应需求: 持久化"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"file where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.action == \"modification\" and\n  file.path like \"/Library/Security/SecurityAgentPlugins/*\" and\n  not file.path like (\"/Library/Security/SecurityAgentPlugins/KandjiPassport.bundle/*\", \"/Library/Security/SecurityAgentPlugins/TeamViewerAuthPlugin.bundle/*\") and\n  not process.name == \"shove\"\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nmacOS修改授权插件\n\n### 为何重要\n在重启或登录后保持立足点\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1547","name":"Boot or Logon Autostart Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1547/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1547.002","name":"Authentication Package","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1547/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1556","name":"Modify Authentication Process","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1556/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":113,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
